[00:00.42] (Cindy Walker)
[00:08.60] I just got your letter, dear sweetheart
[00:14.42] And darling, I miss you oh, so much
[00:23.16] Your letter has cheered me but I'm lonesome
[00:31.22] Lonesome just to feel your loving touch.
[00:39.68] Letters have no arms dear to hold me
[00:46.66] Kisses on paper are so cold
[00:54.12] These sweet things you write in your letter
[01:00.82] I wanna be with you dear when told.
[01:08.60] Letters never bring me the touch of your hand
[01:16.98] Or none of your sweet loving charms
[01:25.00] I get so lonesome for you darling
[01:31.54] And you know that letters have no arms.
